{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-azizi-berton","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"azizi-berton-in-al-furjan","about":"Azizi Berton is an 8-storey residential building in Al-Furjan. The project was implemented by the developer Azizi Developments in cooperation with the architectural company 360 Degrees. The residential complex is distinguished by the quality of natural lighting and panoramic views from its rooms. The property is represented by 191 studios, apartments with 1-2 bedrooms. All living rooms have an elegant finish, are equipped with plumbing, dressing rooms, kitchen sets, as well as necessary furniture.The building has the infrastructure for a healthy lifestyle. The complex provides facilities: gym, sauna, outdoor cafe. Residents will be able to swim in the infinity pool on the roof of the building, visit the health club. There is a playground for children. Parking on two underground floors is intended for personal transport. The complex has 24-hour security and concierge service.The complex has an excellent location, close to well-developed infrastructure, close to Sheikh Zayed Street and close to adult communities such as Al Furjan Villas, Discovery Gardens, The Gardens, JLT and Dubai Marina. A new metro line runs through Al-Furjan, and public transport stops near the complex. The Discovery Pavilion and the Battuta Shopping Center are located nearby. The sea, the beach and the marina are a 10-minute drive away.","price":1546280,"title":"Azizi Berton","bitrix":{"id":546,"pf_id":"are.2.9194","source":null,"project_id":"AZIZI Berton","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Azizi Berton","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Azizi Developments","project_location":"Al Furjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1678/images/2024/04/22/340x252/zrNx4ArYnBgMo0zyySwr8QzazO7CpIj2qySPS4vt.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfro